        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guilford%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Guilford lies at the crossroads of Missouri routes M and AH, roughly three miles north of the Nodaway‑Andrew county line.",
